ly accuse me of being insensitive. You said my mother was strange!"}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You have selective hearing, Marco. I meant her advice was strange ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hmm ... you cleverly got out of that one, didn't you? What's this here? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's my antique sewing machine ... my grandmother used to use it. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: She would make clothes from this? Wow - it's ancient!"}, {"time": "50300", "image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: There you go again - rudely saying whatever pops into your head!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Why is it in the kitchen, anyway? Shouldn't it be in a sewing room?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Does it look like I have a sewing room? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Honestly, I don't know ... you ought to give me a tour."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le12ob02re5aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 3, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le12ob02re6img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob02re6aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 4, "_data": []}]}]}